Helping us tell this story is John Lumis. I'm John Lumis. I'm an architect and an architectural historian. So Che and Fidel drove out to what was the Ritzios most elite country club in Havana. All the members of the club, they practically have all left the country, but still here's this amazing place. The people who work here are still keeping everything clean and neat and taking care of it. And Che and Fidel romp around the bucolic green acres. In full military khaki and combat boots. Chase still wearing that beret.
