And Castro is choking up on a golf club as if he's never seen someone use a golf club before. They're just putting around and grinning while Alberto Corda snapped publicity shots of them. And you know you look at the photographs and they're like school boys just having fun and this was a lark and everybody thought this was you you know, a real, a real hoot. And the photos are actually beautiful because Corda is an incredible photographer, but also because the landscape is breathtaking. There's a river running through all these gently undulating, perfectly manicured hills bordered by this thick, lush forest of tropical plants.
卡斯特罗握着高尔夫球杆的样子，就好像他从没见过别人用球杆一样。他们只是在果岭上推杆，咧着嘴笑，而阿尔贝托·科尔达则在一旁为他们拍摄宣传照。你看这些照片，他们就像玩耍的男学生，这只是一场恶作剧，每个人都觉得这真是太有趣了。这些照片实际上很美，因为科尔达是一位出色的摄影师，也因为这里的风景令人叹为观止。一条河流穿过这些起伏平缓、修剪整齐的山丘，周围环绕着茂密的热带植物森林。

