workers on the golf course making these structures. All the workers felt a real buy-in because they felt that they were building the school that their children could potentially go to, whereas previously they had no hope that their children would go to university or to an art school. And this endeavor was so exciting that the schools basically opened while they were still being built. At some point when construction began, they said, well, let's just use the space. The country club was already there with its meeting rooms and ballrooms, and of course
工人在高尔夫球场上建造这些结构。所有的工人都感到真正的投入，因为他们觉得他们正在建造一所他们的孩子将来可能就读的学校，而在此之前，他们根本不敢奢望自己的孩子能上大学或艺术学校。这项事业如此令人兴奋，以至于学校在还在建设中时就基本上开放了。在施工开始后的某个时候，他们说，好吧，我们就利用这个空间吧。乡村俱乐部已经有了会议室和宴会厅，当然

