they had those manicured grounds on the beautiful weather. Ballerinas pirouetted on the putting green. Painter set up their canvases in the shade, violinists practiced in the forest. And students brought water and drinks and food for the construction workers and played drums to keep their spirits up. It was this beautiful, joyous undertaking, except when it wasn't.
他们有那些修剪整齐的场地和美丽的天气。芭蕾舞演员在果岭上旋转。画家在树荫下支起画布，小提琴手在森林里练习。学生们为建筑工人带来水、饮料和食物，并敲鼓来鼓舞士气。这是一项美丽、欢乐的事业，除了有时并非如此。

